# Local artifacts produced by the M-R0/M-R3 procedures: never commit a brain,
# a compiled device binary, or a build receipt.
#
# NOTE: no bare `ambient` pattern here — it would hide the source directory
# deploy/pi5/ambient/ from git. Only built files are ignored.
*.qtsq
*.qtsq.d/
*.brain.qtsq
*.brain.qtsq.d/
/ambient/ambient
/ambient/seed.brain.qtsq
build/
pi5-baseline-*.json
